---
layout: base.njk
---
<div class="home-shell">
  <section class="home-hero" aria-labelledby="home-title" data-reveal>
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="panel-kicker">PURPLE ORBIT OBSERVATORY</p>
      <h1 id="home-title">안녕하세요, <span class="hero-name"><strong>somani</strong>입니다.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-description">다양한 분야에 호기심을 가지고 공부하며, 새롭게 배운 내용과 직접 경험한 것들을 기록하는 공간입니다.</p>
      <ul class="interest-keywords" aria-label="관심 분야"><li>System Security</li><li>Reverse Engineering</li><li>CTF / Wargame</li><li>Development</li></ul>
      <nav class="hero-actions" aria-label="빠른 탐색"><a class="button primary" href="/archive/">기록 둘러보기 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="button ghost" href="/categories/">카테고리 보기</a></nav>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="home-primary" data-reveal>
    <aside class="surface home-profile-panel" aria-label="{{ profile.nickname }} 프로필">
      <p class="section-kicker">PROFILE</p>
      <a class="profile-orbit" href="/about/">
        <span class="portrait-frame"><img src="{{ profile.image }}" alt="{{ profile.imageAlt }}" width="736" height="781"></span>
        <span class="profile-orbit-copy"><strong>{{ profile.nickname }}</strong><small>{{ profile.tagline }}</small></span>
      </a>
      <dl class="home-identity">
        <div><dt>이름</dt><dd>{{ profile.name }} / {{ profile.nickname }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>소속</dt><dd>{{ profile.affiliation }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>메일</dt><dd><a href="mailto:{{ profile.email }}">{{ profile.email }}</a></dd></div>
      </dl>
      <nav class="profile-links" aria-label="프로필 링크"><a href="{{ site.github }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="{{ profile.tistory }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tistory <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></nav>
    </aside>

    <section class="surface recent-logs" aria-labelledby="recent-title">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="section-kicker">LATEST WRITING</p><h2 id="recent-title">최근 기록</h2></div><a href="/archive/">전체 기록 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
      <div class="log-list">
        {% for post in collections.posts | take(3) %}
        <a class="log-row{% if loop.index == 2 %} project-note{% endif %}" href="{{ post.url }}">
          <span class="log-copy"><strong>{{ post.data.title }}</strong><span class="log-meta"><time datetime="{{ post.date | dateISO }}">{{ post.date | dateISO }}</time><span>{{ post.data.categories[0] }}</span><span>No. {{ post.data.recordOrder | recordLabel }}</span></span></span>
          <span class="row-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="home-categories" aria-labelledby="sectors-title" data-archive-switchboard data-reveal>
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="section-kicker">RESEARCH AREAS</p><h2 id="sectors-title">카테고리</h2></div><a href="/categories/">모든 카테고리 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    <div class="home-category-grid">
      {% for category in topics %}{% set categoryPosts = collections.posts | inCategory(category.name) %}
      <a href="/categories/{{ category.slug }}/" data-category-trigger>
        <span class="category-icon-wrap">{% include 'category-icon.njk' %}</span>
        <span class="category-card-copy"><strong>{{ category.name }}</strong><small>{{ category.description }}</small></span>
        <span class="category-count">{{ categoryPosts | length }}개</span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  {% for project in projects %}
  <aside class="mission-strip surface">
    <span class="section-kicker">CURRENT PROJECT</span>
    <strong>{{ project.name }}</strong>
    <p>{{ project.description }}</p>
    <a href="{{ project.post }}">구축 기록 보기 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </aside>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
